      "chunk_id": "49595fb7e367_0",
      "doc_id": "49595fb7e367",
      "text": "Video quality was TRASH.. *UPDATE 2/25/23ON RETURN CHAOS* about the seller/ company: When this company received the return, they emailed and asked me if I would accept 50% refund because the phone was damaged with a crack? I responded no. BECAUSE no damage to the phone when received nor, when returned. The damage must have happened during shipment or when it was received in the manufacturer facility upon inspection. The entire communication even prior to the refund and return was very difficult. This is a third party company that I do not recommend. These companies are very difficult to communicate with because through Amazon you have no direct communication and it's easy for them to hide behind the screen of Amazon and they try to do some sneaky stuff like this offering you 50% refund. This is not a way to do business, it is a way to loose customers.",
