      "chunk_id": "56a5d04bd9e2_0",
      "doc_id": "56a5d04bd9e2",
      "text": "Phone was reported Lost or Stolen approximately 5 months after purchasing. I received a message from my carrier today advising phone had been shutdown by Sprint (not my carrier). The message advised that I contact Sprint directly. After hours texting with customer service I was told to contact Boost as phone was reported lost/stolen. Contacted Boost was told that my phone could not have been reported today without a Boost account. Now I have a non-functional phone and appear to be out of options. Would appreciate a refund.",
