      "chunk_id": "4569f4d48948_0",
      "doc_id": "4569f4d48948",
      "text": "Phone works well, but be careful of the warranty. Many of the features of this phone work well and is good for its price. Unfortunately for me, I had accidentally dropped my phone after a month of having it. Amazon nor the manufacturer will replace the phone. Amazon says cracks are not covered and Motorola is charging $159 for a $179.99 phone to replace the crack. Before buying this phone, be careful with it. It is fragile.",
