      "chunk_id": "69196e6b6d9b_0",
      "doc_id": "69196e6b6d9b",
      "text": "Voices are not clear and cuts out sometimes. I understand the phone functions and buttons are different, I could get used to that, but I can't hear as clearly on this phone as my previous one. The call volume button doesn't turn it up high enough unless it's on speaker phone, but not all calls are meant for that. I'm going to return this one and am frustrated at the process. I was going to try to stay with this company, but if I have to jump through hoops to contact them with help in selecting a different phone compatible with US Cellular, I may go elsewhere. Why does Amazon try to hide or thwart contacting the Sellers? Ughgg",
